"rationale": "Access (L1-L21) sits inside P03208's active ED emergency encounter (G4) and U0170's scheduled ED shift (G2); every device used is an ED workstation (G11, G15, G19, G23, G28); same-day multi-user access (L46-L75) fits active care; no personal tie exists (G8). Job-related purpose is shown; no review needed."
